    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Education Theme is ideal for educational websites like schools, colleges, universities, coaching institutes, training centers, e-learning platforms, kindergartens, academies, language schools, online course providers, high schools, and professional training institutes. With one-click demo import, getting started is effortless. The theme includes a prominent banner section to highlight key updates or admissions, a dedicated course grid layout to display available programs or classes, and a latest blog section for sharing academic news, study tips, or events. Flex Education also supports custom post types for better content organization and offers easy customization with built-in options to control layouts, colors, and styles without coding. Fully responsive and mobile-friendly, it ensures seamless browsing across all devices. Optimized for SEO, clean typography, and fast-loading performance make it ideal for growing online visibility. The theme integrates smoothly with popular plugins like LearnPress and Advanced Custom Fields, enhancing course management, content flexibility, and student engagement. Perfect for educators, institutions, and course creators, this free theme delivers a professional, lightweight, and feature-rich solution for building an informative and visually appealing education website with ease. https://demo.flextheme.net/flex-education-pro/"
    },
